<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1115 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1115 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $1.00-2.00 higher; butts not tested; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs mostly $3.00 higher, 20-26 lbs firm; sdls. bellies steady to $1.00 higher in a light test; trimmings mostly steady.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings, except very light loin offerings.-USDA</p>
